IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ja-juror`

-- Juries Act 1957 (WA), the questions of the person summonsed -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Facts are from the Western Australian life of Chloe (workbench scenarios/au/wa/cradle-to-grave-chloe), named by
-- event id. Figures marked HYPOTHETICAL are invented for the case and are not the real amounts.
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_wa_juries-act-1957_baseline.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

